        "zsl": "<MISSING_SCOPE>, <MISSING_CONDITION>, the TextSecure application shall add a \"(short) signature\" to the \"SMS message\".",
        "fsl": "For all users, the app must provide an option to add a \"short signature\" to each SMS message.",
        "cot": "<MISSING_SCOPE>, <MISSING_CONDITION>, the TextSecure application <MISSING_MODAL_VERB> add a \"short signature\" to the \"SMS message\"."
