      "reqId": "245-Signal",
      "set": "atomic",
      "nlText": "Request Number - 245 | Request Title - Unable to find to which SIM message was sent | Request Description - Hi, I am using dual sim mobile. I installed TextSecure, but I am unable to know to which SIM the message is sent ? Please help me.",
      "llm": {
        "zsl": "<MISSING_SCOPE>, <MISSING_CONDITION>, the System <MISSING_MODAL_VERB> display the \"SIM used to send the message\" to the User.",
        "fsl": "For all users, <MISSING_CONDITION>, the app must indicate to which SIM a message was sent.",
        "cot": "<MISSING_SCOPE>, <MISSING_CONDITION>, the TextSecure application <MISSING_MODAL_VERB> display the \"SIM used to send the message\" to the user."
