      "nlText": "Request Number - 4230 | Request Title - Auto-split oversized texts | Request Description - Feature Request: Auto-split oversized texts over multiple messages. At the moment they will be truncated. (Telegram messenger auto-splits oversized texts into multiple messages.)",
