          "originalNotes": "It is non-atomic because the request contains multiple distinct lookup/parsing behaviors: Signal Android should support parity with Signal iOS, fix non-contact lookup for non-US users, allow searching phone numbers with or without the “+” prefix, allow searching local/national versions of numbers, try the calling code from the current user’s phone number, and try the calling code from the device’s default region.",
